{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144719,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"\nThe heatmap in the first figure below shows the ROC-AUC of each fixed-recipe model for every combination of training and test dataset, Table IX gives the paired differences for the nine transfer directions, and the forest plot after it shows all 26 paired differences of the fixed-recipe comparison together."}},
