{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144839,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Table VIII. Paired ROC-AUC Differences Within Datasets, Fixed Recipe\nNote. ΔAUC = fixed-recipe SwinFusion++ minus comparator (three-seed ensembles). Intervals: 95% percentile intervals from 5,000 stratified cluster-bootstrap draws, not adjusted for multiplicity. Raw p: two-sided rank-based cluster permutation test (5,000 permutations). Holm p: within-dataset architecture family (m = 8). Celeb-DF v2 intervals are approximate: all 843 fake videos lie in 9 identity clusters."}},
